{"node_id": "11848f8e85db2e916e4adaa1950d6910:table:3", "point_id": "34549499-c25c-59ed-b9eb-77cafe619db8", "vector_names": ["table"], "vector_dims": {"table": 1024}, "payload": {"text": "| 月份 | 销售额 (万元) |\n| ---- | ------------- |\n| 1月  | 100           |\n| 2月  | 120           |\n| 3月  | 320           |\n| 4月  | 240           |\n| 5月  | 110           |", "image_path": null, "image_semantic_type": null, "parent_image_node_id": null, "source_parser": "mineru", "confidence": null, "caption": null, "ocr_text": null, "object_label": null, "object_description": null, "table_markdown": "| 月份 | 销售额 (万元) |\n| ---- | ------------- |\n| 1月  | 100           |\n| 2月  | 120           |\n| 3月  | 320           |\n| 4月  | 240           |\n| 5月  | 110           |", "formula_latex": null, "relationships": {"source_parser": "mineru", "mineru_block_type": "text", "page_node_id": "page:2"}, "node_id": "11848f8e85db2e916e4adaa1950d6910:table:3", "modality": "table", "page": 2, "doc_id": "11848f8e85db2e916e4adaa1950d6910", "section_path": [], "source": "data\\demo_docs\\测试文档.pdf", "chunk_index": 3, "title": "测试文档", "section": null, "parser_name": "mineru", "metadata": {"source": "data\\demo_docs\\测试文档.pdf", "doc_id": "11848f8e85db2e916e4adaa1950d6910", "page": 2, "chunk_index": 3, "title": "测试文档", "section": null, "modality": "table", "parser_name": "mineru", "source_parser": "mineru"}}}
{"node_id": "11848f8e85db2e916e4adaa1950d6910:text:4", "point_id": "f27eb650-3076-50d6-8320-1a073fd813dc", "vector_names": ["text"], "vector_dims": {"text": 1024}, "payload": {"text": "# 测试文档\n\n# 2025年前五个月产品A销售分析\n\n# 一、数据概览\n\n根据图表，产品A在2025年1月至5月的销售额如下：\n\n\n\n\n# 二、趋势分析\n\n整体来看：\n\n- 1月到3月：销售额持续增长，3月达到峰值   \n- 3月之后：销售额开始下降  \n5月：接近年初水平\n\n说明产品可能在3月存在促销或旺季因素。\n\n# 三、简单计算分析\n\n# 1. 平均销售额\n\n公式:\n\n$$\n\\bar {x} = \\frac {\\sum x _ {i}}{n}\n$$\n\n计算：\n\n$$\n\\bar {x} = \\frac {1 0 0 + 1 2 0 + 3 2 0 + 2 4 0 + 1 1 0}{5} = 1 7 8\n$$\n\n平均销售额为 178万元\n\n# 2. 增长率（以2月→3月为例）\n\n公式:\n\n增长率 $= \\frac{\\text{本期} - \\text{上期}}{\\text{上期}}$\n\n计算：\n\n$$\n\\frac {3 2 0 - 1 2 0}{1 2 0} = 1. 6 7\n$$\n\n2月到3月增长显著\n\n# 四、结论\n\n- 3月为销售高峰，应重点分析原因（活动/市场需求）  \n- 后续月份下滑明显，需考虑优化策略  \n- 建议关注季节性波动并制定对应营销方案\n\n2025年销售额  \n![](images/f1d950480a1c25612d5d826d178e70859595889b5ef232b230a0243754736bcd.jpg)\n\n<details>\n<summary>line</summary>\n\n\n</details>", "image_path": null, "image_semantic_type": null, "parent_image_node_id": null, "source_parser": "mineru", "confidence": null, "caption": null, "ocr_text": null, "object_label": null, "object_description": null, "table_markdown": null, "formula_latex": null, "relationships": {"source_parser": "mineru", "mineru_block_type": "formula", "page_node_id": "page:1"}, "node_id": "11848f8e85db2e916e4adaa1950d6910:text:4", "modality": "text", "page": 1, "doc_id": "11848f8e85db2e916e4adaa1950d6910", "section_path": ["测试文档"], "source": "data\\demo_docs\\测试文档.pdf", "chunk_index": 4, "title": "测试文档", "section": "测试文档", "parser_name": "mineru", "metadata": {"source": "data\\demo_docs\\测试文档.pdf", "doc_id": "11848f8e85db2e916e4adaa1950d6910", "page": 1, "chunk_index": 4, "title": "测试文档", "section": "测试文档", "modality": "text", "parser_name": "mineru", "source_parser": "mineru"}}}
